.IX Title "LEI-EXPORT-KW 1"
.TH LEI-EXPORT-KW 1 1993-10-02 public-inbox.git "public-inbox user manual"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
lei\-export\-kw \- export keywords (flags) to Maildir and IMAP folders
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
lei export\-kw \-\-all=[<remote|local>]
.PP
lei export\-kw MFOLDER [MFOLDER...]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\f(CW\*(C`lei export\-kw\*(C'\fR propagates keywords (e.g. \f(CW\*(C`seen\*(C'\fR, \f(CW\*(C`answered\*(C'\fR,
\&\f(CW\*(C`flagged\*(C'\fR, etc.) from lei/store to IMAP folders and/or Maildirs.
It only works for messages lei knows about (e.g. was used as a
\&\f(CW\*(C`lei q \-\-output\*(C'\fR, or imported via \fBlei\-import\fR\|(1), or indexed
via \fBlei\-index\fR\|(1)).
.PP
It does not delete, write, nor modify messages themselves;
it only sets metadata on Maildirs and IMAP folders.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
.IP \-\-all 4
.IX Item "--all"
Export to all local Maildirs and remote IMAP folders
.IP \-\-all=local 4
.IX Item "--all=local"
Export all local Maildirs
.IP \-\-all=remote 4
.IX Item "--all=remote"
Export all remote IMAP folders
.SH CONTACT
.IX Header "CONTACT"
